bellido -- Bellido system
*************************

  * Usage: 
        bellido(kk)
  * Inputs:
      * kk, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, the coefficient ring
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of the polynomials in the system

Description
===========

This system was solved in May 2020, using *note solveSystem:
(NumericalAlgebraicGeometry)solveSystem_lpList_rp, in Macaulay2 v1.15 with an
